      "content": "<p>The number of atomic orbitals from the following having 5 radial nodes is ___________.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.237ex\" height=\"2.009ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 6734.7 888\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(894,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1338.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1838.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"70\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-70\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2394.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2839.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(3339.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3733.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4178,0)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4678,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"70\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-70\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(5234,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5678.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(6178.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>",
